a. implementing protection policies for women and children victims of violence established by the government;
b. establishing policies, programs, and activities for protection of women and children victims of violence;
c. collecting data and information about women and children victims of violence;
d. providing support for facilities and infrastructure for the implementation of Protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence;
e. establishing PPT;
